abstract: >-
  Code and data for a twin-experiment study of when an operating pumping record can answer a
  what-if question about stopping or increasing pumping. Includes the record generator, response-family
  envelope, zero-effect fits, linearization, history-intervention and aggregation code, protocols fixed
  before outcomes were computed, aggregate and case-level tables, and scripts that rebuild Table 3,
  the figures and the principal numbers.
